ng":"zh"},"children":["不进单位就是灵活就业：养老和医疗要自己在就业地参保，户籍限制已经放开"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"zh","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["不进单位，不等于没有社保这回事，只是没人替你交那一半。文件要求各地放开灵活就业人员在就业地参保的户籍限制，个别超大城市可以逐步放开。所以别把「自由」理解成不用管社保。断着不交，退休金和医保报销都要按断缴的规则算。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["养老和医疗要你全额自己缴，按当地的缴费基数算，每月上千元。缴费基数就是一个用来算保费的基准数。这是灵活就业最容易被漏算的固定支出，难在每个月都得按时交。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["参保看《关于维护新就业形态劳动者劳动保障权益的指导意见》。它写着：「各地要放开灵活就业人员在就业地参加基本养老、基本医疗保险的户籍限制，个别超大型城市难以一步实现的，要结合本地实际，积极创造条件逐步放开。组织未参加职工基本养老、职工基本医疗保险的灵活就业人员，按规定参加城乡居民基本养老、城乡居民基本…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：不进单位就是灵活就业：养老和医疗要自己在就业地参保，户籍限制已经放开"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["养老和医疗要你全额自己缴，按当地的缴费基数算，每月上千元。缴费基数就是一个用来算保费的基准数。这是灵活就业最容易被漏算的固定支出，难在每个月都得按时交。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["参保看《关于维护新就业形态劳动者劳动保障权益的指导意见》。它写着：「各地要放开灵活就业人员在就业地参加基本养老、基本医疗保险的户籍限制，个别超大型城市难以一步实现的，要结合本地实际，积极创造条件逐步放开。组织未参加职工基本养老、职工基本医疗保险的灵活就业人员，按规定参加城乡居民基本养老、城乡居民基本医疗保险，做到应保尽保。督促企业依法参加社会保险。企业要引导和支持不完全符合确立劳动关系情形的新就业形态劳动者根据自身情况参加相应的社会保险」。同一份文件把用工分成三类：「符合确立劳动关系情形的，企业应当依法与劳动者订立劳动合同。不完全符合确立劳动关系情形但企业对劳动者进行劳动管理……指导企业与劳动者订立书面协议……个人依托平台自主开展经营活动、从事自由职业等，按照民事法律调整双方的权利义务」（全国，2021 年起）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["人力资源社会保障部等八部门 (2021). 关于维护新就业形态劳动者劳动保障权益的指导意见（人社部发〔2021〕56 号，第二、八条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-07/23/content_5626761.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-07/23/content_5626761.htm"]},"；国务院办公厅 (2020). 关于支持多渠道灵活就业的意见（国办发〔2020〕27 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2020-07/31/content_5531613.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2020-07/31/content_5531613.htm"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["原文写的是「放开」户籍限制，还给超大城市留了口子，不是「全国已经取消」。到底放开到什么程度，问你要参保的那个城市。收益量级定「大」，是因为断缴丢的是养老和医疗待遇本身，值的钱远过万元。但成本也实打实，全额自缴每月上千元。社保断缴之后怎么补、年限怎么累计，见第 7 节第 18 条（社保断缴）。换城市以后养老和医保关系怎么转过去，见第 19 节第 19 条（养老和医保关系转到新参保地）。自己交职工养老按哪一档交、要领多少年才回本，见第 5 节第 46 条（自己交职工养老保险）。另外，在政府指定的地点和时间卖农副产品、日用品，或者用自己的手艺做依法不需要许可的便民活儿，不用办营业执照。这一条写在国办发〔2020〕27 号里。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/31-10"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"学历不是一锤子买卖：自考不限年龄和已受教育程度，成人高考和开放大学都能补"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/31-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"送外卖、跑网约车、拉同城货运，平台按单给你交职业伤害保障费，自己不缴"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/31-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["想进体制内不止考公一条：基层服务项目干满两年，能报每年 10% 的定向考录计划"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["想进体制内，不是只有考公一条路。「三支一扶」这类基层服务项目干满两年、考核合格，就能报只面向这些人的定向考录计划。各省每年要拿出公务员考录计划的 10% 左右招…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/31-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["特岗教师三年服务期满、考核合格又愿意留下的，应当及时入编"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["特岗计划是少数几条写明「期满入编」的路。条件是本科及以上学历、以师范类专业为主，年龄不超过 30 周岁，还要有相应的教师资格证。服务期三年，这三年的工资待遇跟当…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/31-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["消防员和军队文职是另外两个公开招录的口子，门槛比考公低"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["这两条路都不卡「大专以上」这道门槛。消防员招 18 到 22 周岁、高中以上文化程度的人，大专以上学历的人和退役士兵可以放宽到 24 周岁。军队文职只要求年满…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/31-13"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["高考填志愿那天就能锁定编制的两条路：公费师范生和定向医学生，代价是 6 年履约"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["这两条路都是国家先替你出钱，你毕业后按协议去指定的地方干 6 年。公费师范生只在六所教育部直属师范大学招，提前批录取。定向医学生在拿到入学通知书前就要签三方协议…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/31-14"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["想出国打工，先查这家公司有没有对外劳务合作经营资格：它不得向你收押金"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["出国打工这件事，法律管的不是你，是组织你出去的那家公司。只有拿到对外劳务合作经营资格证书、又办了登记的企业才能干这个。听到「先办旅游签过去再转工签」，这句话本身…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/31-15"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["在家给境外公司远程干活，这笔钱在税法上算境内所得：个税自己报，收汇走「职工报酬」"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["这笔钱算境内还是境外，看的是你在哪儿干活，不是钱从哪儿打进来。人在国内远程给境外公司干活，算境内所得，要在境内交个税。境外公司在中国没有机构，没人替你代扣，这笔…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/31"},"children":["阅读整个主题：十八岁之后有哪几条路 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0